  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "A public field of the type RuntimeAnimatorController throws an exception in game, but not in editor. \nThis exception doesn't crash the Udon behaviour, but will clear all other ref-type fields on it. This might be related to Odin not being able to deserialize this runtime construct (according to Merlin). \nRuntimeAnimatorControllers are needed to e.g. switch them out on a station on runtime.\nTest world: https://discord.com/channels/652715801714884620/675459259441610807/846841473047199764\n(Note: This world will intentionally crash the 2 behaviours in Start() to debug-print the heap dump, showing that the ref-type fields on one of them are nulled by this issue. The deserialization error however is unrelated to that and happens earlier.)",
